---
title: Release Train Lifecycle
---
stateDiagram-v2
    %% Runnable example for: archify import state
    %% See archify/importers/README.md for the supported subset.
    [*] --> Queued
    Queued --> Building: change accepted
    Building --> Verifying
    state Verifying <<choice>>
    Verifying --> Live: checks passed
    Verifying --> Approval: policy hold
    state "Needs Approval" as Approval
    Approval --> Cancelled: denied
    Live --> Paused: SLO regression
    Paused --> RolledBack
    Live --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    RolledBack --> [*]
    note right of Paused
        health gate open
    end note
